# Android's fixed-point AAC decoder (PacketVideo), from AOSP frameworks/base
# at android-4.0.4_r2.1, media/libstagefright/codecs/aacdec, the files
# unchanged (Android's media-framework glue, SoftAAC, left out). C written
# as C++ (pre-C++11: a table relies on its narrowing rules), called from C
# (its API is extern "C"), with build_config.h (ours) for what Android's
# build file defined. Built for plain AAC only: AAC_PLUS (SBR, HE-AAC) and
# PARAMETRICSTEREO (HE-AAC v2) are not defined. Apache License 2.0
# (NOTICE); patents: patent_disclaimer.txt.
# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
